message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "A Hybrid Kolmogorov-Arnold and Deep Neural Network Architecture for Low Cost Multi-Fidelity Modeling with Sea Surface Temperature Application in the Boston Harbor"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-18
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/AngadKumar16/mf_comparision
authors:
  - family-names: Kumar
    given-names: Angad
    affiliation: "Obra D. Tompkins High School, Katy, TX, USA"
